---
title: "initialize (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate params
    q_validate --> q_check_refund: params valid
    q_validate --> q_revert_invalid: params invalid
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_check_refund --> q_set_config: 1 hour <= refundPeriodSeconds <= 2 weeks
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: invalid refund period
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert InvalidRefundPeriod
    q_set_config --> q_set_addresses: set refundPeriodSeconds, fee bps values
    q_set_addresses --> [*]: set bidToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry, legionBouncer, legionSigner

    note right of q_set_config
        INV-001: 3600 <= refundPeriodSeconds <= 1209600 (1h to 2w)
        INV-002: no predetermined end time (open-ended sale)
        INV-003: askToken not set at initialization (set at TGE publication)
        INV-004: fee bps values are immutable after initialization
    end note
